  "body": "Direct-PR: generated refresh of the « Nouveautés » data after today's ledger fold (#1387), requested by #1379's hand-off.\nClaim: cloud/orch\nAuthor model: Opus 5.5 (cloud/orch) — script output, no hand edit\n\n**Problem.** `App/SwiftHFR/Resources/changelog-v1.json` was last exported on 2026-11-10; every ledger fold since then added rows to `docs/CHANGELOG-LEGACY.md` that the « Nouveautés » screen does not show.\n\n**Change.** `python3 tooling/docs/export-app-changelog.py` on dev-swift `46cd75dc`+#1387: 163 entries (valid JSON). Reproduce: run the same command on this PR's base and `git diff --exit-code` against the head.\n\nNo `### Ledger`.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
